;s record runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids. August to September came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 62% of normal in August to September and 72% in September to October. So far in 2026, March to April sits at 57% and February to March at 60% on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
